  "body": "### What is the issue with the URL Standard?\n\nUTS 46 revision 31 added a _IgnoreInvalidPunycode_ flag to its ToASCII and ToUnicode operations. The URL Standard should be explicit about the value of this flag when it calls into ToASCII or into ToUnicode.",
